{"id": "1535159422807056415", "channel_id": "1535156360923193354", "author_id": "304652156286533642", "author_name": "sbpan", "content": "Hello there : )\n\nFirst off, who did you choose for your moonless guide ?\nDid you find Cheri's handbook ? ( just type /new to find it ).\n\nYou will eventually want 5 functionnal teams so I can only recommend your play with all four realms until you grasp the way they work and pull until you get all standards awakeners you enjoy.\n\nDid you hit a wall ? Do you need specific help ?", "timestamp": "2026-08-07T05:35:28.280000+00:00", "thread_id": "1535156360923193354", "edited_timestamp": "2026-08-07T05:37:11.180000+00:00", "thread_title": "Team advice/suggestion", "forum_channel_id": "1356200968311803956", "thread_tags": ["1400747489132412979", "1400747088995811358"]}
